# Poni Island's wild places: the oldest island, a long way from anywhere, rock and thin grass under a salt wind. A bamboo flute
# in E minor, slow and hollow, a slide guitar answering from the second part, a warm pad, a bass walking its root and fifth,
# timpani and a log drum like a slow heartbeat and a few low congas and wood blocks; at night an ocarina and a harp.
# Original composition for this game, in the modern sound.
title Poni Island
tempo 84
meter 4/4
reverb 0.34
nighttempo 0.9
room hall 2.6

